prompts.moveset:
This is the history of {who} in a Pokémon anime series, from Bulbapedia. Using only this text, which moves did {who} know or use at {moment}? Choose up to four, only from this list: {moves}. Return JSON: {{"moves": [up to four names exactly as listed], "evidence": [{{"move": name, "where": the episode or battle the text ties it to}}], "notes": one sentence on how sure the text is}}.

TEXT:
{text}

prompts.ace:
This is Bulbapedia's text about {who}'s Pokémon and history. The team for '{version}' is: {team}. Using only this text, which one Pokémon does it treat as {who}'s ace (strongest, most trusted, or saved for last)? Return JSON: {{"ace": one name from the team or null, "quote": the sentence that says so, "notes": one sentence}}.

TEXT:
{text}

prompts.career:
These are lines from Bulbapedia's page on {who}. Using only them, what was {who}'s result at the {event}? The record currently says: {current}. Return JSON: {{"result": the result in a few words, or null if the lines don't say, "episode": the episode code if given}}.

LINES:
{text}
